8111075,2024-01-05,Mortgage,Conventional home mortgage,Closing on a mortgage,Closing disclosure or other related disclosures,"We believe that Intercoastal Mortgage, through Vice President and Senior Loan Officer XXXX XXXX, engaged in predatory lending, as well as violations of both the Truth In Lending Act and the Real Estate Settlement Procedures Act, by withholding material negative information from us concerning the homebuilder we were considering hiring and who insisted we use Intercoastal for construction of our new family home. Specifically, Intercoastal either knowingly or negligently withheld the fact that XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX had a history of not finishing ( let alone beginning ) construction within the time period required under Intercoastal 's loan terms. This information would have had a direct impact on our decision to undertake a loan with Intercoastal. We believe that despite the language in the loan contract that Intercoastal has hidden behind in response to complaints from other affected families, Intercoastal and XXXX XXXX maintained an ongoing relationship with XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX and therefore stood to gain financially by collaborating with a homebuilder who is now facing multiple felony accounts for fraud and larceny in XXXX XXXX, XXXX  ( XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX ). 

