Questions for XXXX : What would XXXX stand to gain through its relationship with a builder who was clearly known for permitting delays, construction delays, incomplete, late, and in most cases shoddy work? Furthermore, by not disclosing negative information on this builder to prospective clients, was there a financial incentive to be gained in the form of higher rates ( interest rates were increasing in XXXX ) and fees knowing the proposed house would not be constructed in the contracted 12-month timeframe? Lastly, why would XXXX be the required lender for the builder if no relationship is supposed to exist between the XXXX? 

